  (text "D1 isolates the 5 V buck from USB-powered VSYS.\nPico VBUS is unused externally. No USB-to-buck backfeed path."
    (at 265 228 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "4c7e7ea1-09d2-413a-9459-1e1b7185fa0b"))
  (text "TPS54202H follows TI 5 V reference: 15uH, 100k / 13.3k feedback, 75pF feed-forward.\nNominal output 0.596 x (1 + 100 / 13.3) = 5.08 V. 2 A regulator; budget <=1.8 A.\nC20..C23: four 10uF / 25 V X7R; approx 34uF typical at 5 V bias, before tolerance.\nC10 damps input cable transients; C12/C13/C14 must be close to VIN/GND.\nKeep the BOOT/SW loop short; keep FB clear of SW and lamp-return currents."
    (at 20 252 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "0af08e2b-b4b4-4371-b385-22dba38ab7dd"))
